#: src/WordPress/Fields/RatingField.php:18
msgid "Rating"
msgstr "Bewertung"

#: src/WordPress/Fields/RecordingField.php:48
msgid ""
"Only the listed audio/video formats are supported. WordPress restrictions "
"also apply."
msgstr ""
"Nur die aufgeführten Audio-/Videoformate werden unterstützt. Zusätzlich "
"gelten die WordPress-Beschränkungen."

#: src/WordPress/Fields/RecordingField.php:56
msgid "Recording time limit (seconds)"
msgstr "Aufnahmezeitlimit (Sekunden)"

#: src/WordPress/Fields/RecordingField.php:57
msgid ""
"Limits browser recording only. Uploaded media is checked for file type, "
